Apple Vision Pro owners have a new Apple Immersive video available to watch from today. "Debut at the BBC Proms" is a full classical music concert filmed at the Royal Albert Hall during the 2025 Proms season, courtesy of BBC Arts.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/03/bbc-proms-concert-apple-immersive-video.jpg" alt="" width="1472" height="828" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1042762" /><br/>
Filmed by Livewire Pictures using Blackmagic's URSA Cine Immersive cameras, the experience follows Austrian piano sensation Lukas Sternath as he takes to the stage in his BBC Proms debut, performing Edvard Grieg's Piano Concerto in A Minor with the BBC Symphony Orchestra, under chief conductor Sakari Oramo.<br/>
<br/>
